      <title>美国男子多次干扰特斯拉赛博出租车 车辆紧急制动刹停路中间</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/robotaxi/post/20260909/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E8%B5%9B%E5%8D%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%A7%9F%E8%BD%A6-%E8%BD%A6%E8%BE%86%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E5%88%B6%E5%8A%A8%E5%88%B9%E5%81%9C%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4/</link>
